{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Plan review PASS (signed at 13d4a73cde2). Claimed. Advisory follow-ups: box has /usr/bin/docker-init (tini de40ad0, Docker 25.0.16, compose v2.32.4) so init: true / --init resolve there. A 3rd raw-fetch path also feeds the zombies: review_bot/gerrit_client.py clone_change_ref (git fetch --depth 2 without maintenance suppression). Gerrit and opcert get init only at their next compose-up (autodeploy recreates review-bot and MCP only); AC2 is measured over all processes in the review-bot container's pid namespace, since after the fix orphans re-parent to docker-init, not uvicorn."},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1795401987307397001,"uuid":"b121d101-bee1-44f4-9e1e-a2555efff390"}